# POC-VMS-39 static-loader regression checklist

- [ ] Fake CLI exercises only version and rules paths/list/show commands.
- [ ] Full and truncated rule displays are distinguished byte-exactly.
- [ ] Isolated HOME/XDG artifacts and every fixture are included in integrity checks.
- [ ] Existing output, duplicate cells, raw-stream tampering and symlinks fail closed.
- [ ] Historical unindexed auxiliary files remain PARTIAL rather than being rewritten.
- [ ] Supplemental audit hashes the source tree without modifying it.
- [ ] Tests make no model, Solver, database, Redis or network call.
